OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after police
OL,4,Apursuit crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has died after being
OL,7,Fstruck by a car during a police
OL,8,Fpursuit.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police said officers
OL,11,Fin a marked patrol vehicle were
OL,12,Fpursuing a car in East Reach, Taunton,
OL,13,Fat about 23:15 GMT on Friday, moments
OL,14,Fbefore the collision.
OL,16,FThe pursued car later collided with a
OL,17,Fpedestrian, a 73-year-old man. He was
OL,18,Ftaken to hospital in a critical
OL,19,Fcondition but died from his injuries on
OL,20,FSunday afternoon, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
