OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after police
OL,4,Apursuit crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FJack Hawkings, 23, from Wellington in
OL,7,FSomerset, is due to appear at Taunton
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court later charged with
OL,9,Fdeath by dangerous driving, failing to
OL,10,Fstop for police and driving without
OL,11,Finsurance or a licence.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
